usage: train_rgbt_cmdistill.py [-h] --config CONFIG --arm
                               {cmdistill_literal,cmdistill_corrected}
                               --teacher-weights TEACHER_WEIGHTS --output
                               OUTPUT [--device DEVICE] [--seed SEED]
                               [--batch BATCH] [--workers WORKERS]
                               [--max-steps MAX_STEPS] [--validate-only]

CMDistill-adapted trainer: native YOLO11 loss + PCCFD/SLRD/IBCLD. Modes follow
the ALIGN_AND_IMPROVE plan: IR-teacher (privileged) to weak student on the
frozen paired dataset config. The teacher is a frozen single-modality
detector; inference keeps the plain student graph.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --arm {cmdistill_literal,cmdistill_corrected}
  --teacher-weights TEACHER_WEIGHTS
  --output OUTPUT
  --device DEVICE
  --seed SEED
  --batch BATCH
  --workers WORKERS
  --max-steps MAX_STEPS
  --validate-only

